# mascotkit environment variables
#
# Only needed if you want the optional "Describe it" AI generation.
# Everything else in the studio works without any key.
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local:   cp .env.example .env.local
# 2. Get a key at https://platform.claude.com (Settings > API keys)
# 3. Paste it after the = sign below, with no quotes or spaces
# 4. Restart the dev server (stop it, then run npm run dev again)
#
# .env.local is ignored by git, so your key is never committed.
# Never put a real key in this .env.example file.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
